---
layout: layout.njk
styles: /styles/home.css
---


#hero
  .two-column
    %div
      %h1
        .span Pick-a-Pic
      %p
        Build
        %strong functional communication skills
        \ with an iPad app that is
        %strong easy to personalize
        \ for your learners.
      %a.app-store{ href: "#" }
        %span Download on the App Store
    %div
      .video-frame
        %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
          %source{ src: "/assets/video/speak-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }

.one-column
  %h2
    Made for
    %strong your
    \ pictures
  %p
    Motivate your learner by using pictures of the exact things they want.
    %br.wide-only
    Import pictures from these sources with only a few taps:
  %ul.feature-list
    %li Camera
    %li Photos
    %li Files
    %li Copy & Paste
    %li Emoji
    %li Text
    %li Our Gallery

.two-column.arrow
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/import-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div
    %p
      From photo to tappable button in seconds.
      Create the buttons you need as soon as you need them. 

.two-column.arrow.two-column-reverse
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/arrange-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div
    %p
      It only takes one tap to turn an imported picture into a button on a page.
      Buttons arrange themselves automatically. Drag to rearrange them.

.two-column.arrow
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/pages-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div
    %p
      Quickly navigate and rearrange pages while editing. 

.two-column.arrow.two-column-reverse
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/lock-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div
    %p
      Drag and hold to exit a book.
      Keep books open by locking them with either Face ID or a four-digit passcode.

.one-column
  %h2
    Made for
    %strong collaborating
  %p
    Caregivers, behavior analysts, and therapists can
    %a{ href: "#" } share Pick-a-Pic files 
    %br.wide-only
    with each other by using
    %strong Dropbox
    , 
    %strong Google Drive
    , or 
    %strong iCloud file sharing
    .

.one-column
  %h2
    %strong No
    \ account needed
  %p
    %strong No
    \ signing up.
    %strong No
    \ account creation.
    %strong No
    \ user tracking.
    %br.wide-only
    Pick-a-Pic respects your time and your privacy.

.one-column
  %h2 A growing list of features
  %ul.inline-list
    %li
      %span Organize your picture library using
      %a{ href: "#" } search
      ,
      %a{ href: "#" } sort
      , and
      %a{ href: "#" } tags
      .
    %li
      %span Quickly fix mistakes with
      %a{ href: "#" } undo and redo
      .
    %li
      %a{ href: "#" } Choose the voice
      \ that speaks when pictures are tapped.
  %p
    Pick-a-Pic is in active development.
    %a{ href: "#" } Visit our product roadmap
    \ to see the features that are coming next.

.one-column
  %a.app-store{ href: "#" }
    %span Download on the App Store


%script{ type: "text/javascript", src: "/scripts/hero.js" }
%script{ type: "text/javascript", src: "/scripts/video.js" }